              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "GAP-06 (B): field boundary ≈ 1.1:1 light / 1.3:1 dark — further below WCAG 1.4.11 (3:1) than A. If chosen, mitigate: always-visible labels (done), 40 px min height, never placeholder-only fields, clear focus ring (2 px blue.500), error state keeps 2 px red border. Optional: fill fields with surface.subtle #FAFAFA to add a second cue.",
