                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "fRKy2",
                      "name": "Decision value",
                      "fill": "#1F1E1C",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Source: boards 09/10 exploration → locked v3 frames (Phones · v3 no-50 scale, H4d LIGHT/DARK · v3) + ‘Neutral scale · v3’. Owner: “tolong update color tokens primitive … perbaharui semantic color … jangan ubah nama variable semantic”; input border “gas ini A · soft (B2)”. PERSISTED: primitives neutral.150 #F0F0F2, .250 #DCDCE0, .650 #484850; semantic re-values (names unchanged) surface.canvas 100/900, surface.panel 0/850, surface.subtle 100/900, surface.sunken 100/900, surface.muted 200/700, border.default 150/800, border.subtle 150/800, border.input 250/650, text.primary 900/0, text.muted 500/400. 498 tokens (64 primitive · 54 semantic · 317 component), checksum 72fc8da3 (repo = live). Library boards 00/01/02 refreshed; lib saved 22:22 (4,176,887 B). src/ui/theme/tokens.css regenerated (tokens:check OK). RULES v3 APPROVED 2026-09-28 (Owner: “ya”): L1 shell = surface.muted, L2 content = surface.canvas, L3 card = surface.panel; B1 = border.default/subtle, B2 = border.input for fields + app-panel edge + sidebar divider; T1–T3 = text.primary/secondary/muted; small shell text uses text.secondary. Accepted gaps: border.input 1.37:1 / 1.81:1 (extends GAP-06); text.muted light < 4.5:1 on canvas/shell. NEXT: phase C component retargets and G/H4d shell components, then consumer refresh.",
