                      "name": "Decision value",
                      "fill": "#1F1E1C",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "From F-17 app-shell-revamp design (docs/features/app-shell-revamp/design.md). N1 active nav = action.primary pill + on-primary, semibold label; hover = former surface.panel pill. H1 heading 26/bold/−0.6/tight for phone page titles (font.size.heading, letter-spacing.heading). C1 selected list item = semibold label + action.primary check (component.sheet.item.check). Accepted exception: N1 dark pill vs surface.muted 2.02:1 (mitigated by semibold label, icon colour change, aria-current). Owner: “ok agree”. Tokens and components are promoted by /sdv:save-design-system.",
