                      "content": "Tokens: 531 (64 primitive · 54 semantic · 347 component), checksum 594f560b (repo = library). New: font.size.heading 26, font.letter-spacing.heading −0.6, nav.item.icon-hover, sheet.item.check; retargeted nav.item.background-active/text-active/icon-active/background-hover, badge.danger.padding-x (→ space.2). Boards: 00 cover counts, 03 heading row, 06 Nav/Sheet/Badge rows, 07 N1·H1·C1. Components: Workspace Pill K06oq, Mobile Header o8T8zb, Compact Bar J3Ppgp, Toast/Danger C3PCyx, Menu/List I3q8f, Count Badge/Danger HoAYC (C14 merged), Page Header Utilities, Nav Item active/hover, Mobile App Shell / Mobile Shell / Bottom Nav (Invoice) / Menu sheet / Tablet shell updates. Not done: consumer rebinding (app-shell-revamp.pen, workspace.pen, auth.pen, message-templates.pen) and /sdv:verify-design-system.",
