              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "V033K",
                  "name": "Accessibility title",
                  "fill": "#1F1E1C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility assumptions  ·  WCAG 2.1 AA (C-008)",
                  "lineHeight": 1.35,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "j0Fs5",
                  "name": "Accessibility details",
                  "fill": "#1F1E1C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· White on blue.500 #2F5BFF = 4.94:1 (AA) in both modes — chosen over #2F6BFF (4.50:1).\n· Dark: action uses the same blue.500 with a white label (user 2026-09-26); near-black label would be 4.0:1 → fail. Blue.500 vs dark panel #18181B = 3.6:1 → OK for UI boundaries/icons, NOT for small blue text on dark (use info fg #8FAEFF for links).\n· neutral.400 #A1A1AA as text = 2.6:1 → fails on white; column heads/placeholders use neutral.500 (4.8:1).\n· lime.300 never carries text on light; lime.800 on lime.50 ≈ 6.6:1. Amber 700 on amber 50 ≈ 4.6:1.\n· Focus ring 2 px blue.500 · touch targets ≥ 44 px on the mobile client gallery (GAP-04).",
                  "lineHeight": 1.35,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
