          "id": "KTCJs",
          "name": "Board description",
          "fill": "#5E5B55",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "PROVISIONAL 2026-09-28 · Owner request: the current Mobile App Shell (C35) header and content feel off; the Bottom Nav (board 06 option B, approved) stays. Current issues: the header is a bare title on a white bar (no back affordance for sub-pages, no workspace context), and content is white cards floating on grey with one uniform 16 inset. Five directions (A–C, then D–E on the Owner's request for two more), each shown on a top-level page (Dasbor), a list page (Template pesan) and a sub-page (Bagikan gallery editor from F-03). Values are the approved Studio Lime tokens, written as literals (exploration only). Nothing enters tokens.json or the library until the Owner picks. Outcome: Option G approved (Owner 2026-09-28); desktop counterpart H4d on board 10.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
