              "content": "Top bar carries the workspace switcher (pill, left) and actions (right), so the brand context is always one tap away. Top-level pages get an iOS-style large title that scrolls with the content (collapses into the bar on scroll). Sub-pages swap the pill for a back button + centred title + a text action (Simpan). Content stays inset-grouped: white 16-radius groups on the grey canvas, 16 side gutter, 24 between groups. Bottom Nav stays on every page.",
