              "content": "One white surface from header to Bottom Nav: no floating cards, no grey canvas. The header shows the workspace as a tappable overline (ASTER WEDDING ▾) above a 24 title, so every page states where you are. Content is split by section headers and inset hairlines (Settings-app style); stats sit in a hairline grid. Sub-pages are pushed full-screen: the Bottom Nav hides, the app bar gets back + title + an overflow menu (Kembalikan ke default), and the primary action sits in a sticky bottom bar within thumb reach.",
