              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A dark Studio Lime header (neutral-900, lime workspace mark) holds context: workspace pill, actions, page title and — on Dasbor — the headline numbers. Content rises over it as a rounded grey sheet (24 top radius), so the page reads as ‘context on top, work below’. Most brand-forward option; the dark band also gives the status bar a stable colour. Sub-pages keep the dark band compact (back + title + Simpan) and keep the Bottom Nav.",
