        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pdpQi",
          "name": "Option G — C header + B ",
          "fill": "#1F1E1C",
          "content": "Option G — C header + B grouping + E cards (Owner mix) · DIRECTION APPROVED",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jXvkE",
          "name": "Owner 2026-09-28: ‘Optio",
          "fill": "#5E5B55",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Owner 2026-09-28: ‘Option C is more attractive; I like B's grouping, but prefer the cards and items of E's Template pesan; use the library Segmented Control.’ Follow-up: ‘item separators should still be thin borders; use the existing Textarea component.’ Header = Option C (dark brand band, workspace pill, actions, 26 title, headline numbers on Dasbor). Content = Option C's grey sheet (24 top radius) holding B-style groups (overline section header + optional link) whose bodies are E-style white cards (20 radius) with a 1px border/default #E4E4E7 outline with 44 square icon wells, rows split by a full-width 1px bottom stroke #F4F4F5 (border/subtle) on each item. The editor uses linked library instances: Segmented Control (C23) for Edit/Pratinjau and Textarea (C04) for the message. Follow-up 2: ‘cards must have a border too.’ Follow-up 3: the Segmented Control track (component/segmented/track = surface/sunken = neutral-100) merged with the grey sheet (also neutral-100); the instance's track is overridden to surface/muted (neutral-200 #E4E4E7) for this study — to adopt it, retarget component/segmented/track to surface/muted in tokens.json (affects every segmented control) or add a contextual track token. Follow-up 4: the workspace switcher is the desktop Sidebar switcher (component/sidebar/workspace/* — panel background, border/default, radius/sm, lime mark 20), without the mark (no camera icon, no lime square): name + chevrons only. Follow-up 5: switcher colours taken from Option C's dark pill (fill #27272A neutral-800, border #3F3F46 neutral-700, name #FFFFFF, chevrons #A1A1AA neutral-400) on the desktop switcher shape (radius/sm 8, padding 8/12). These on-dark colours have no light-mode semantic token yet (DESIGN TOKEN GAP). DECISION: direction APPROVED — Owner 2026-09-28: “ok menarik2, mari kita lanjutkan kembali ke @message-template.pen — saya puas dengan explorasi Option G — C header + B grouping + E cards (Owner mix) dan H4d · H4c shell (dark sidebar, breadcrumb bar with full-width border, white hero, grey panel) …” Token set NOT yet approved: new values (on-dark surfaces/text, card radius 20, icon-well radius 14, segmented track) go through /sdv:design-tokens first.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
