          "content": "PROVISIONAL 2026-09-28 · Owner: ‘I like this colour combination (board 09 Option G) — explore the desktop App Shell with the same combination.’ Mapping: the mobile dark header becomes the Sidebar (neutral-900 #18181B shell, on-dark switcher #27272A / #3F3F46 / #FFFFFF / #A1A1AA without mark); the mobile grey content sheet becomes the App Panel (#F4F4F5, 16 radius, inset 8 from the dark shell); page content uses G's grouping — overline section headers over white cards with a #E4E4E7 border and #F4F4F5 item strokes, 44 square icon wells. Nav on dark: default #A1A1AA, hover/active surface #27272A, active label white with a lime (#C6F432) icon. Library instances are used where they exist (Textarea C04, Button C01). Literal values are exploration only. Outcome: H4d approved (Owner 2026-09-28) with mobile Option G.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
