              "type": "text",
              "id": "D5Hty",
              "name": "H4d caption",
              "fill": "#5E5B55",
              "content": "H4d · H4c shell (dark sidebar, breadcrumb bar with full-width border, white hero, grey panel) with the board 03 representative-case content as-is: greeting + New project in the hero; the four metric cards, Today timeline + This week, and the Booking & production table in the content (English sample copy, literal colours). DECISION: direction APPROVED for the desktop App Shell (with Option G for mobile) — Owner 2026-09-28: “ok menarik2, mari kita lanjutkan kembali ke @message-template.pen — saya puas dengan explorasi Option G — C header + B grouping + E cards (Owner mix) dan H4d · H4c shell (dark sidebar, breadcrumb bar with full-width border, white hero, grey panel) …” Token set not yet approved. Switcher study (Owner 2026-09-28, ‘coba’): H1–H3 + H4d switchers now use EXISTING tokens only — fill surface.inverse, border border.control (3.7:1), name + chevrons text.inverse; H4/H4b/H4c keep the #27272A / #3F3F46 / #A1A1AA version for comparison.",
              "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "PfCK1",
              "name": "H4d DARK caption",
              "fill": "#5E5B55",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1440,
              "content": "H4d · DARK — the chrome INVERTS like surface.inverse (Owner 2026-09-28: ‘the sidebar colour must be inverted too’): Sidebar #FAFAFA, raised (switcher, active nav) #E4E4E7, switcher border #D4D4D8, text #18181B, secondary #52525B, active nav icon = accent.on-inverse dark (#3F6212); content follows the existing dark tokens: panel sheet surface.canvas #09090B, hero / cards / table surface.panel #18181B, wells & table head #1F1F23, borders #27272A, text #FAFAFA / #D4D4D8 / #A1A1AA, status colours = their dark token values. Library buttons render with k:mode dark.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
